"Ending a process may destroy data, break the session or introduce a security "
"risk. Only unresponsive processes should be ended."
msgstr ""
"Beëindiging van 'n proses mag data vernietig, breek die sessie of stel 'n "
"veiligheid risiko. Slegs prosesse wat nie reageer nie, moet beëindig word."

